      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am not sure if Discord should be listed there (it isn't listed in the footer on VRChat.com), but [VRChat's Instagram account @vrchat](https://www.instagram.com/vrchat/) seems to be completely abandoned since July 2019 and is currently absent from the VRChat.com footer as well, which makes me think at least the Instagram account definitely shouldn't be there anymore.",
